Notes for redistributors
------------------------
* This project patches the user's own copy of stellaris.exe at runtime and
  ships no game code. Do not commit game binaries (stellaris.exe, .dll files
  from the game folder) to a public repository.
* The idea of replacing Stellaris' memory allocator to obtain 2 MB large pages
  comes from the community project LargePageInjectorMods (KeinNiemand). This
  implementation shares no code with it: it uses a different delivery mechanism
  (static PE patch instead of DLL injection) and a different interception point
  (iat hooks on the heap APIs instead of signature scanning).
